  &to ERGOL_LAYER  &kp FR_AGRV  &kp FR_EACU   &kp FR_EGRV      &circ FR_E    &tild FR_N  &trans  &trans            &a1xx K7 K4   &a1xx K7 K5  &circ FR_I       &diae FR_I
  &kp FR_UGRV      &kp FR_SECT  &a1xx K4 K5   &to ERGOL_LAYER  &a01xx K7 K3                      &a01xx K5 K0      &a01xx K5 K1  &a1xx K4 K5  &to ERGOL_LAYER  &a01xx K7 K3
                                &a01xx K5 K0  &a01xx K5 K1     &trans                            &trans            &trans        &trans
